// Permit Transfer when a prior Transfer for this user resolved (any output).
// Empty -> {} accepts any response regardless of output field values. The decimal filter is absent here
// so any Transfer amount satisfies the body.
// At a Read timepoint the Transfer scope prevents this from being a
// determining policy even though the resolved predicate body is still satisfied.
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Transfer",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h Drupe::Action::"Transfer"::response{ input.user: context.input.user }
};
